flowchart TB
  Q([Turn 1200: what is my gym locker code?])
  Q --> N[Keep everything<br/>send the whole conversation, every time]
  Q --> S[Summarise<br/>fold old turns into a running summary]
  Q --> E[Extract facts<br/>a model writes memory notes,<br/>a search brings the right ones back]
  Q --> V[Summary plus verbatim recall<br/>search my own old messages,<br/>paste the matches at the end]
